=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Hieronymus} and select this {p:Campaign Op|Campaign Ops}
* Talk to {n:Adjutant} (J-9), and he'll ask you for a craft to specialize in.
** You have to have a developed craft of at least **level 61** to attempt this op. He will turn you away if you don't meet the requirement.
** Time is limited when selecting the crystal and ingredients.
** You will have to give him ingredients for **TWO** different recipes in the craft you have chosen.
** You will fail the mission if you take too long to select the crystals and ingredients or choose the wrong ones.
** Recipes will require up to **eight** ingredients. If a recipe has less than Eight ingredients, it is necessary to select the __"No more ingredients are required"__ option after selecting the appropriate ingredients.
* Once you've completed your two tests, go back and talk to {n:Hieronymus} for your reward.

